<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher than Thursday's close. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    59.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Sows under 500 lbs steady, over 500 lbs 0.50-1.50 lower.</p>
<p>Top 50.50.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 1-2	500-550 lbs    50.50</p>
<p>US 1-3	550-700 lbs    50.50</p>
</text>
